WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:39.090
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:39.360 --> 01:41.820
[Episode 37]

3
01:59.439 --> 02:01.519
You're finally back.

4
02:02.519 --> 02:07.020
So you went to see the woman you love, the one you risked everything to bring back?

5
02:12.120 --> 02:13.784
I've told you before.

6
02:13.784 --> 02:16.795
Stay out of my business.

7
02:16.795 --> 02:21.120
And above all, I don't want you bothering her.

8
02:21.120 --> 02:23.880
I'm here to congratulate you.

9
02:23.880 --> 02:25.933
You finally got what you wanted.

10
02:25.933 --> 02:30.400
Keeping her close, watching over her day and night.

11
02:31.480 --> 02:33.260
But it's a pity.

12
02:33.920 --> 02:37.026
Even if you keep her locked up,

13
02:38.880 --> 02:43.060
she'll never spare you a single glance.

14
02:59.400 --> 03:00.700
Miss Tao.

15
03:01.520 --> 03:03.960
I hope you remember your place.

16
03:04.800 --> 03:07.439
You're my wife in name only.

17
03:07.439 --> 03:10.560
Beyond that, you're nothing to me.

18
03:27.120 --> 03:28.820
If you regret it,

19
03:29.760 --> 03:34.413
what's between us can end at any time.

20
03:36.440 --> 03:39.520
Jiang Xue Ting, don't bite the hand that feeds you. You ungrateful wretch!

21
03:39.520 --> 03:42.373
Without the Tao family, you wouldn't be where you are today!

22
04:16.139 --> 04:17.520
Don't worry about me, Jin.

23
04:17.520 --> 04:19.960
I know what I must do now.

24
04:19.960 --> 04:21.720
The front is still unstable, after all.

25
04:21.720 --> 04:23.126
You should head back soon.

26
04:24.080 --> 04:25.693
I'm not going back.

27
04:48.200 --> 04:50.706
This was Ming Xuan's most precious item.

28
04:54.160 --> 04:56.340
It's time to put it in your hands.

29
05:09.160 --> 05:14.306
Inside are the names of the people your brother cared about most

30
05:16.800 --> 05:19.426
and the things he never got the chance to do.

31
05:28.240 --> 05:30.153
Now that you've pulled yourself together,

32
05:31.280 --> 05:34.746
a weight's finally off my chest.

33
05:35.560 --> 05:39.686
It's time for me to leave and do what I've always wanted to.

34
05:41.000 --> 05:42.913
As for the Xiangxi Hotel,

35
05:44.080 --> 05:46.700
find someone reliable to take over.

36
05:55.680 --> 05:57.340
Jin, without you,

37
05:58.600 --> 06:02.319
the Xiangxi Hotel might as well close down.

38
06:06.840 --> 06:12.720
What we remember fondly was never the place itself.

39
06:14.560 --> 06:15.920
It's the people.

40
06:17.240 --> 06:18.473
Chang Xuan.

41
06:21.240 --> 06:22.433
Take care.

42
06:27.540 --> 06:31.640
Though miles may part us, we'll meet again.

43
06:58.400 --> 06:59.573
Chang Xuan.

44
07:00.600 --> 07:03.160
A secret telegram from the Southern Government.

45
07:03.160 --> 07:05.886
Their special commissioner will visit Nanhuai for the third time.

46
07:13.600 --> 07:15.480
To Deputy Commander Yu:

47
07:15.480 --> 07:19.480
The battle at Nanping made your name renowned nationwide.

48
07:19.480 --> 07:22.160
Yet one man's glory comes at the cost of many,

49
07:22.160 --> 07:28.320
the people left in misery, their lifeblood drained, and soldiers' lives spent.

50
07:28.320 --> 07:33.433
While our great land is at the mercy of foreign powers,

51
07:33.433 --> 07:36.480
we're trapped in civil war, brothers killing brothers.

52
07:36.480 --> 07:39.920
What good is great achievement?

53
07:40.520 --> 07:45.230
Only the unification of North and South will bring peace and win the people's hearts.

54
07:45.230 --> 07:49.790
And your deeds will be remembered for generations.

55
07:51.520 --> 07:56.037
In the autumn of 1928, the situation between North and South became clearer.

56
07:56.037 --> 07:57.924
Yu Chang Xuan assessed the situation

57
07:57.924 --> 08:02.303
and began once more to meet the representatives of the Southern Government.

58
08:16.680 --> 08:19.839
[Yu Army's Deputy Commander Yu Chang Xuan Telegraphs Allegiance to Central Government]

59
08:19.839 --> 08:26.073
Extra! Extra!

60
08:52.280 --> 08:53.459
Chang Xuan.

61
08:55.360 --> 08:57.960
I found fresh lotus seeds and lilies at the market.

62
08:57.960 --> 08:59.800
I simmered them for two hours.

63
08:59.800 --> 09:01.920
It's perfect to drink now.

64
09:01.920 --> 09:03.657
You stay up late so often.

65
09:03.657 --> 09:05.344
This will help soothe your nerves.

66
09:05.344 --> 09:07.240
Drink it while it's hot.

67
09:07.240 --> 09:08.400
Thank you.

68
09:26.600 --> 09:28.200
Dai Ti.

69
09:28.200 --> 09:29.400
Yes?

70
09:33.400 --> 09:37.166
Thank you for taking care of me recently.

71
09:38.040 --> 09:42.080
In the battle at Nanping, I owe even more to the Jun family's full support.

72
09:42.080 --> 09:47.190
Although your father and mine haven't said it, I know what they're thinking.

73
09:47.190 --> 09:51.160
That's precisely why I must be clear with you.

74
09:53.760 --> 10:00.400
I've been wondering when you'd bring this up.

75
10:03.680 --> 10:07.880
I know the place Miss Ye holds in your heart.

76
10:08.616 --> 10:10.880
I've never thought of replacing her,

77
10:10.880 --> 10:13.420
nor have I ever wanted to be anyone's shadow.

78
10:14.160 --> 10:15.400
Chang Xuan.

79
10:17.000 --> 10:21.000
Staying by your side to care for you was my own choice.

80
10:22.160 --> 10:23.380
Dai Ti.

81
10:25.320 --> 10:27.440
I'm not worth such devotion.

82
10:27.440 --> 10:31.193
Whether it's worth it is my call.

83
10:33.320 --> 10:36.320
The world is in turmoil with constant warfare.

84
10:36.320 --> 10:38.750
It's the people who suffer.

85
10:38.750 --> 10:42.789
But you have the power to change all of this.

86
10:43.760 --> 10:46.817
I'm willing to stand with you, doing everything I can.

87
10:46.817 --> 10:50.859
Serving our country is also my dream.

88
10:52.240 --> 10:54.390
You mean...

89
10:54.390 --> 10:58.164
What we need now is a marriage in name only.

90
10:58.164 --> 11:03.913
With my family's support, the Southern Government will be wary of yours.

91
11:05.800 --> 11:10.413
I hope I can be of some help.

92
11:13.640 --> 11:14.753
Dai Ti.

93
11:16.880 --> 11:21.653
Thank you for everything and for your honesty.

94
11:23.440 --> 11:25.641
There's no need to thank me.

95
11:28.720 --> 11:33.900
Seeing you pull yourself together is enough for me.

96
12:46.760 --> 12:47.860
Take him away.

97
12:47.860 --> 12:48.960
Yes, sir.

98
12:51.120 --> 12:52.360
What are you doing? Let go!

99
12:52.360 --> 12:54.100
Let go!

100
12:55.040 --> 12:59.100
Ping Jun, you haven't recovered yet.

101
12:59.100 --> 13:00.440
You need to rest.

102
13:01.200 --> 13:03.000
The baby will disturb your rest.

103
13:04.240 --> 13:06.240
I want to keep him with me.

104
13:06.240 --> 13:08.933
I'll take care of him. Give him back to me.

105
13:11.159 --> 13:14.059
I've hired the best nanny in Jiang City.

106
13:14.059 --> 13:15.919
He'll be well taken care of.

107
13:18.080 --> 13:19.680
As for seeing him...

108
13:23.440 --> 13:26.000
let's make a rule, alright?

109
13:26.000 --> 13:30.313
If you eat well, take good care of yourself,

110
13:31.320 --> 13:32.980
and don't try to run away,

111
13:33.840 --> 13:35.713
I'll let you see him.

112
13:40.960 --> 13:42.299
Ping Jun.

113
13:43.040 --> 13:46.457
Why do you keep resisting me now?

114
13:46.457 --> 13:48.697
You weren't like this before.

115
13:49.840 --> 13:56.000
Back then, we'd sit across from each other and read together for the whole day.

116
13:56.000 --> 13:58.760
Your eyes were so bright.

117
13:59.440 --> 14:01.440
And they were always on me.

118
14:02.200 --> 14:05.340
Back then, we'd walk side by side on the street,

119
14:06.200 --> 14:08.346
and we had endless things to share.

120
14:09.000 --> 14:11.700
Why are you so stingy with me now?

121
14:12.360 --> 14:15.960
You won't even spare me a few words.

122
14:20.680 --> 14:22.346
Ping Jun.

123
14:23.400 --> 14:28.526
You understood me back then, and I understood you.

124
14:29.440 --> 14:32.700
We were the perfect couple in this life.

125
14:33.760 --> 14:39.480
If it weren't for Yu Chang Xuan, you'd still see me that way.

126
14:43.920 --> 14:45.319
Jiang Xue Ting.

127
14:46.440 --> 14:48.393
Stop it.

128
14:49.560 --> 14:52.401
What will it take for you to give me back my child?

129
14:53.960 --> 14:57.280
Behave yourself and stay by my side,

130
14:59.560 --> 15:02.317
and the child will grow up safe and sound.

131
15:02.317 --> 15:03.520
But...

132
15:08.059 --> 15:12.860
You'd better not bring up that bastard in front of me.

133
15:12.860 --> 15:15.539
Every time you mention him,

134
15:15.539 --> 15:21.146
I'm reminded he carries the blood of someone I despise.

135
15:22.400 --> 15:27.160
I can't guarantee I won't lose control.

136
15:27.160 --> 15:28.501
So,

137
15:30.720 --> 15:32.320
don't force my hand.

138
15:43.920 --> 15:48.960
It's only been a year since we changed sides.

139
15:48.960 --> 15:54.300
They talked about building a republic and unifying as brothers.

140
15:55.200 --> 15:58.820
And now? They've turned on us in a heartbeat.

141
15:59.680 --> 16:01.563
Look at what's written here.

142
16:01.563 --> 16:04.720
They want to reduce the Yu Army by one-third.

143
16:04.720 --> 16:07.240
And military expenses must be audited by the Central Government.

144
16:07.240 --> 16:08.652
This isn't a reorganization.

145
16:08.652 --> 16:11.800
They're using a dull knife to bleed us dry.

146
16:11.800 --> 16:18.000
It seems now that the so-called reunification is just an excuse to eliminate dissidents.

147
16:18.000 --> 16:22.217
The Central Government has become a tool for personal dictatorship.

148
16:22.217 --> 16:24.240
Then, what should we do?

149
16:24.240 --> 16:26.190
We can't just sit here and wait for death.

150
16:26.190 --> 16:27.680
Send a reply to Nanjing.

151
16:27.680 --> 16:30.000
Downsizing is a grave matter.

152
16:30.000 --> 16:31.706
It requires careful consideration.

153
16:43.486 --> 16:46.120
Nanjing's troop reduction order is out.

154
16:46.120 --> 16:50.280
Since you're aware of it, Deputy Commander Yu, why haven't you taken action?

155
16:50.280 --> 16:53.920
Are you planning to disobey orders?

156
16:53.920 --> 16:57.870
Director Jiang, you should know that to forget war is to invite danger.

157
16:57.870 --> 17:02.680
The Japanese are preparing for war, pressing forward in North China.

158
17:02.680 --> 17:06.733
Downsizing now is like crippling ourselves.

159
17:06.733 --> 17:08.760
Stop using the Japanese as an excuse.

160
17:08.760 --> 17:13.671
If everyone occupies territory in the name of national defense,

161
17:15.166 --> 17:16.920
how can we achieve a greater good?

162
17:16.920 --> 17:20.280
The Japanese are killing at will in Jinan.

163
17:20.280 --> 17:22.640
Six thousand soldiers and civilians died.

164
17:22.640 --> 17:26.680
Yet the National Government signed an agreement with Japan.

165
17:26.680 --> 17:30.920
They won't hold the Japanese accountable, turning a blind eye to the atrocities.

166
17:30.920 --> 17:36.840
Is this the greater good the Central Government speaks of?

167
17:39.559 --> 17:41.400
Everyone has their own duties.

168
17:42.059 --> 17:47.559
This matter will be handled by the Ministry of Foreign Affairs.

169
17:47.559 --> 17:49.380
Soldiers should not interfere in politics.

170
17:50.000 --> 17:51.510
Don't you know this rule?

171
17:51.510 --> 17:54.720
Director Jiang, what you see are political orders.

172
17:54.720 --> 17:59.480
What I see is life and death.

173
17:59.480 --> 18:02.533
The troop reduction is not up for discussion.

174
18:03.960 --> 18:05.460
Deputy Commander Yu.

175
18:06.320 --> 18:07.999
We both serve the country.

176
18:08.799 --> 18:10.460
It's normal to have disagreements.

177
18:11.119 --> 18:15.079
Actually, in private, I do understand you.

178
18:15.880 --> 18:20.440
Hold on to military power, and you hold the cards.

179
18:20.440 --> 18:26.380
As the saying goes, the greater the fear, the greater the need to be on guard.

180
18:26.380 --> 18:27.680
After all,

181
18:28.740 --> 18:32.720
you suffered the loss of your wife not long ago.

182
18:32.720 --> 18:35.160
It's natural to be suspicious and fearful.

183
18:46.619 --> 18:51.200
Deputy Commander Yu, the Government is determined to reduce troops.

184
18:51.200 --> 18:54.381
One cannot go against the tide.

185
18:58.560 --> 19:04.500
Director Jiang, thank you for considering every detail for the Yu Army.

186
19:04.500 --> 19:07.646
But the Yu Army's guns are meant to fight enemies,

187
19:08.480 --> 19:11.321
not to be used by politicians for their own ends.

188
19:35.520 --> 19:36.810
What is it?

189
19:36.810 --> 19:40.960
Does the singing and dancing inside not suit your taste?

190
19:40.960 --> 19:43.019
Had to come out for some air?

191
19:48.160 --> 19:52.759
Just now, Jiang Xue Ting was pressing hard.

192
19:54.120 --> 19:58.860
Do you also want to push the Yu Army into a dead end?

193
20:04.533 --> 20:06.584
I am his wife.

194
20:06.584 --> 20:10.660
If I don't help my husband, who am I supposed to help? An outsider?

195
20:20.259 --> 20:22.619
You help Jiang Xue Ting rise just to deal with

196
20:23.400 --> 20:27.113
Chang Xuan and the Yu family, right?

197
20:33.520 --> 20:35.280
Exactly!

198
20:35.280 --> 20:38.743
Li Bo Ren, listen to me carefully.

199
20:38.743 --> 20:41.257
I have only one goal.

200
20:41.257 --> 20:44.560
To do everything I can to bring down Yu Chang Xuan.

201
20:44.560 --> 20:47.504
I want to see him fall with my own eyes.

202
20:47.504 --> 20:52.444
I want to see him crawl like a stray dog and kneel before me.

203
20:59.040 --> 21:00.461
Tao Zi Yi.

204
21:02.079 --> 21:03.539
You have every right to hate him,

205
21:04.440 --> 21:07.440
but don't let that resentment drown your conscience.

206
21:08.160 --> 21:12.657
I don't care whose wife you are or how harsh your words may be.

207
21:12.657 --> 21:14.517
I've always believed that...

208
21:16.400 --> 21:21.546
the Tao Zi Yi I know, though spoiled and willful,

209
21:22.760 --> 21:24.720
is kind at heart.

210
21:28.360 --> 21:29.719
Don't be naive.

211
21:38.000 --> 21:43.040
Don't let yourself become someone that even you can't stand.

212
21:59.560 --> 22:02.080
[One year later]

213
22:40.980 --> 22:43.539
Miss Ye, you're awake.

214
22:48.460 --> 22:50.579
Thank you, Dr. Xie.

215
22:50.579 --> 22:52.280
You stayed with me all night again.

216
22:52.280 --> 22:54.920
It's nothing. It's my duty.

217
22:55.720 --> 23:00.520
By the way, I haven't seen Xiao Yu Er for a long time.

218
23:00.520 --> 23:01.900
Is he alright?

219
23:02.619 --> 23:04.579
He's doing well.

220
23:04.579 --> 23:07.946
He just keeps crying out for his mother.

221
23:11.640 --> 23:16.559
Once your fever breaks and you've recovered, you'll see him soon.

222
23:24.440 --> 23:28.259
Dr. Xie, tell me,

223
23:29.080 --> 23:34.279
after Nora left home, will she ever return?

224
23:35.280 --> 23:38.126
Miss Ye, you've read "A Doll's House" too?

225
23:39.360 --> 23:45.240
Back when I was at the girls' school, I often read Ibsen's plays.

226
23:47.480 --> 23:53.840
Forgive my bluntness, but Miss Ye, given your insight and eloquence,

227
23:53.840 --> 23:57.586
you're certainly not one of those women who live off men.

228
23:57.586 --> 24:02.586
How did you end up... trapped here?

229
24:09.360 --> 24:10.720
Dr. Xie,

230
24:11.440 --> 24:15.861
although you were hired by Jiang Xue Ting,

231
24:16.880 --> 24:21.406
I can tell you're not like him.

232
24:23.400 --> 24:27.180
Thank you for taking care of me this past year.

233
24:27.759 --> 24:32.980
I can feel that your concern for Xiao Yu Er and me is genuine.

234
24:38.160 --> 24:39.561
Now,

235
24:40.480 --> 24:45.759
there is one thing that only you can help me with.

236
24:46.760 --> 24:50.646
Miss Ye, what do you mean?

237
24:58.680 --> 25:00.000
Careful.

238
25:02.980 --> 25:04.259
Miss Ye, please, get up.

239
25:04.259 --> 25:05.993
What is this for?

240
25:08.680 --> 25:10.321
Please help me.

241
25:13.440 --> 25:14.859
This letter.

242
25:15.520 --> 25:18.620
Please deliver it to the Yu's Mansion in Nanhuai.

243
25:19.940 --> 25:24.019
I am the wife of Deputy Commander Yu Chang Xuan.

244
25:25.000 --> 25:29.740
Once he sees this letter, he'll come to rescue me.

245
25:32.680 --> 25:36.039
I know this is extremely dangerous.

246
25:36.880 --> 25:39.860
If you don't want to, I won't force you.

247
25:40.800 --> 25:45.221
You can destroy this letter and pretend you never saw it.

248
26:16.120 --> 26:17.400
Thank you.

249
26:21.000 --> 26:22.320
Thank you.

250
26:30.400 --> 26:33.570
Sir, these are today's letters.

251
26:33.570 --> 26:36.010
There are a few urgent letters from Nanjing.

252
26:47.640 --> 26:49.720
[To Yu Chang Xuan] [From Ping Jun]

253
27:26.120 --> 27:30.320
[Held captive at Jiang Xue Ting's residence in Jiang City. Come take me home.]

254
27:40.460 --> 27:42.539
Uncle. Chang Xuan.

255
27:42.539 --> 27:45.160
You don't need to worry about the downsizing pressure from Nanjing.

256
27:45.160 --> 27:47.330
My father sent a telegram from Washington.

257
27:47.330 --> 27:50.680
Stimson, the United States Secretary of State, is closely watching China.

258
27:50.680 --> 27:53.240
The Americans don't want Nanjing

259
27:53.240 --> 27:56.720
to centralize power by force and trigger another civil war.

260
27:56.720 --> 28:01.759
But Nanjing seems pretty determined this time.

261
28:01.759 --> 28:05.440
I'm afraid this matter won't be settled easily.

262
28:05.440 --> 28:09.740
Their most pressing needs right now are money and weapons.

263
28:09.740 --> 28:13.360
My uncle controls several arms deals that Nanjing wants the most.

264
28:13.360 --> 28:16.080
If they insist on reducing the Yu Army,

265
28:16.080 --> 28:20.770
he'll use loans and arms deliveries to pressure Nanjing.

266
28:20.770 --> 28:25.090
The Nanjing Government will weigh its options and make the right choice.

267
28:37.440 --> 28:41.440
[From Ye Ping Jun]

268
29:29.520 --> 29:32.759
Master Jin, we're running out of ammunition!

269
29:32.759 --> 29:33.859
Hold your ground.

270
29:33.859 --> 29:36.730
This batch of penicillin is to save lives in the epidemic zone.

271
29:36.730 --> 29:38.099
It must not fall into their hands.

272
29:38.099 --> 29:39.099
Yes, sir.

273
29:51.880 --> 29:54.019
Come on, you brats!

274
30:03.720 --> 30:05.559
Retreat!

275
30:21.759 --> 30:23.586
It's all imported medicine.

276
30:25.680 --> 30:27.779
I was patrolling nearby.

277
30:27.779 --> 30:31.319
I didn't expect to run into an old friend.

278
30:36.400 --> 30:40.400
Jin, anything you want to tell me?

279
30:45.080 --> 30:50.073
These medicines are being sent to the Soviet Area border.

280
30:50.073 --> 30:51.952
Typhoid has broken out there.

281
30:53.720 --> 30:55.620
Many civilians have died.

282
30:58.360 --> 30:59.659
So...

283
31:02.520 --> 31:04.133
you're a Communist.

284
31:04.759 --> 31:05.773
Yes.

285
31:07.200 --> 31:09.160
I've joined the Communist Party.

286
31:13.519 --> 31:15.279
I should have guessed.

287
31:16.680 --> 31:18.881
I've read my brother's diary.

288
31:19.940 --> 31:22.266
I saw the vision you two had back then.

289
31:23.120 --> 31:25.440
The seeds were planted long ago.

290
31:27.160 --> 31:29.319
When Ming Xuan and I were in Tokyo,

291
31:30.420 --> 31:34.980
we often attended speeches by democratic revolutionaries.

292
31:35.759 --> 31:37.160
After returning to China,

293
31:38.560 --> 31:42.373
I traveled all over Shenyang for our Reading Society at first.

294
31:43.339 --> 31:48.019
But... after meeting Mr. Liang Wen Bo,

295
31:48.019 --> 31:54.519
I realized that what can best save this country was the Communist Party.

296
31:55.400 --> 32:00.000
Four years ago, Wen Bo sponsored my membership

297
32:01.220 --> 32:03.019
and I officially joined the Party.

298
32:04.259 --> 32:05.460
Chang Xuan.

299
32:07.039 --> 32:08.759
I want to thank you.

300
32:09.759 --> 32:14.033
The Xiangxi Hotel gave me a convenient cover.

301
32:15.280 --> 32:18.040
I've helped many members and their families.

302
32:19.140 --> 32:25.273
Otherwise, many of them would've been handed in to Nanjing for the reward.

303
32:29.519 --> 32:30.779
Jin.

304
32:32.779 --> 32:34.920
The path you've chosen is dangerous,

305
32:36.579 --> 32:38.420
but you walk it with honor.

306
32:40.319 --> 32:42.579
I know your and my brother's ambitions.

307
32:44.180 --> 32:45.720
I won't stand in your way.

308
32:47.640 --> 32:49.120
I'll only support you.

309
32:54.259 --> 32:55.819
Fill their tank with gas.

310
32:55.819 --> 32:58.700
Get another car to lead the way for them.

311
32:58.700 --> 32:59.740
Yes, sir.

312
33:01.500 --> 33:02.693
Come.

313
33:06.400 --> 33:07.700
Go ahead.

314
33:09.920 --> 33:11.220
Take care.

315
33:14.220 --> 33:15.420
Let's go.

316
33:52.160 --> 33:57.980
Chang Xuan, why didn't you tell him you came here to save him?

317
34:00.640 --> 34:02.300
There's no need for that.

318
34:29.360 --> 34:30.480
Brother.

319
34:32.360 --> 34:34.099
I'm here to see you again.

320
34:35.039 --> 34:37.560
Back then, I went against all objections

321
34:37.560 --> 34:42.420
and led the Yu Army to switch sides to pledge allegiance to Nanjing.

322
34:44.039 --> 34:46.260
I thought I was doing the right thing.

323
34:48.520 --> 34:50.566
I thought that without civil war,

324
34:52.139 --> 34:55.080
the people could live a peaceful life.

325
34:55.080 --> 34:57.500
But at the Nanjing Government meeting,

326
34:58.160 --> 35:03.893
I heard them treat hundreds of lives as trivial topics,

327
35:05.840 --> 35:08.366
as nuisances to be avoided.

328
35:08.960 --> 35:14.480
I thought this world was doomed.

329
35:15.760 --> 35:17.040
But, Brother,

330
35:18.960 --> 35:20.753
there is a group of people

331
35:22.440 --> 35:24.840
who've shown me another possibility.

332
35:25.559 --> 35:27.400
Is the dream you held

333
35:29.139 --> 35:34.239
to walk this path with people like them?

334
35:50.040 --> 35:53.880
Dr. Xie, how is the baby?

335
35:53.880 --> 35:56.579
He has a slight fever. We need to bring his temperature down.

336
35:56.579 --> 35:59.679
Go boil a bowl of scallion water and bring some strong liquor.

337
35:59.679 --> 36:01.380
We need to sponge the child down.

338
36:01.380 --> 36:02.920
- Yes. - Hurry.

339
36:07.139 --> 36:11.199
Dr. Xie, was the letter delivered?

340
36:11.199 --> 36:14.560
I personally asked someone to deliver it to the Yu's Mansion in Nanhuai.

341
36:14.560 --> 36:17.184
He was certain it reached the butler.

342
36:17.184 --> 36:22.624
But it's been several days, and there's still no reply.

343
36:23.840 --> 36:26.086
It's like a stone sinking into the sea.

344
36:29.360 --> 36:31.960
That's impossible.

345
36:31.960 --> 36:37.179
If Chang Xuan saw the letter, he'd definitely come to save me.

346
36:42.800 --> 36:48.760
Dr. Xie, I invited you here to treat patients,

347
36:48.760 --> 36:51.020
not to play postwoman.

348
36:52.560 --> 36:54.200
Jiang Xue Ting.

349
36:54.200 --> 36:55.800
I asked her to send the letter.

350
36:55.800 --> 36:57.519
Don't kill the innocent.

351
37:04.519 --> 37:06.599
You're fired.

352
37:06.599 --> 37:07.699
Get out.

353
37:24.099 --> 37:25.246
Ping Jun.

354
37:26.160 --> 37:31.440
So, your obedience lately was all just an act, wasn't it?

355
37:32.079 --> 37:35.840
You were just playing along for that bastard child.

356
37:36.739 --> 37:39.099
Why ask when you already know the answer?

357
37:44.000 --> 37:49.200
You've been wondering why Yu Chang Xuan didn't come for you after receiving the letter, right?

358
37:50.840 --> 37:52.380
I can tell you.

359
37:56.400 --> 37:59.160
You'll understand once you read this.

360
37:59.160 --> 38:01.166
[Deputy Commander Yu To Wed the Jun Family's Daughter]

361
38:07.920 --> 38:14.000
The Commander and Madam wanted to match Miss Jun with Master Chang Xuan as children.

362
38:14.000 --> 38:18.853
From family background to looks, they were a match made in heaven.

363
38:19.500 --> 38:20.920
Impossible.

364
38:20.920 --> 38:22.920
That's impossible.

365
38:22.920 --> 38:24.926
Absolutely impossible.

366
38:26.460 --> 38:30.280
Ping Jun, you're still too naive.

367
38:31.280 --> 38:33.519
Do you know the background of the Jun family?

368
38:34.480 --> 38:38.380
Her uncle is China's envoy to the United States.

369
38:38.380 --> 38:41.639
Her father is a famous Chinese pastor.

370
38:41.639 --> 38:45.340
Their family can influence the Southern Government's

371
38:45.340 --> 38:48.213
access to all the arms and loans it wants from the United States.

372
38:49.059 --> 38:53.119
Now the Southern Government wants to curb the warlords and dismantle the Yu Army.

373
38:53.119 --> 38:55.619
Yu Chang Xuan needs to oppose Nanjing.

374
38:55.619 --> 38:57.960
He wants to secure his military power.

375
38:57.960 --> 39:01.500
In the face of power and ambition,

376
39:02.139 --> 39:05.920
does your love even matter?

377
39:06.560 --> 39:09.953
So even if he received your letter, he'd never come to save you.

378
39:10.560 --> 39:15.500
Only Jun Dai Ti can help him rise to the top.

379
39:17.880 --> 39:19.613
He has already given up on you.

380
40:10.000 --> 40:11.460
Jiang Xue Ting.

381
40:13.680 --> 40:17.081
Don't waste your breath trying to drive a wedge between us.

382
40:18.240 --> 40:19.606
Let me tell you.

383
40:20.520 --> 40:25.720
No matter what happens, I will always trust Chang Xuan.

384
40:28.760 --> 40:31.481
Even if he had his engagement announced,

385
40:33.600 --> 40:37.246
even if he couldn't come to save me right away,

386
40:39.440 --> 40:44.080
I still believe that he has his reasons.

387
40:46.500 --> 40:47.659
Guards!

388
40:50.800 --> 40:52.139
What are you doing?

389
40:53.940 --> 40:55.320
Take the child away.

390
40:55.320 --> 40:56.579
Yes, sir.

391
40:57.920 --> 41:00.940
He still has a fever! Are you crazy?

392
41:00.940 --> 41:03.079
Let go! Let go of him!

393
41:03.079 --> 41:04.239
What's wrong with you?

394
41:04.239 --> 41:05.699
The child still has a fever!

395
41:05.699 --> 41:07.159
Jiang Xue Ting!

396
41:11.159 --> 41:12.340
Ping Jun!

397
41:14.519 --> 41:18.539
Since you're so distracted and you can't take care of the child,

398
41:20.240 --> 41:22.860
I'll find someone else who can.

399
41:22.860 --> 41:26.360
When you finally learn to forget Yu Chang Xuan,

400
41:26.360 --> 41:28.639
you'll see your child again.

401
41:30.119 --> 41:32.239
Jiang Xue Ting.

402
41:32.239 --> 41:33.753
I beg you, Jiang Xue Ting!

403
41:36.099 --> 41:38.679
Jiang Xue Ting, give him back to me!

404
41:39.440 --> 41:41.100
Jiang Xue Ting!

405
41:42.019 --> 41:44.840
Give my child back to me!

406
41:46.480 --> 41:48.980
Give him back to me!

407
41:53.059 --> 41:55.519
Please, give him back.

408
42:54.039 --> 42:55.260
Ping Jun.

409
42:58.079 --> 42:59.739
Happy New Year.

410
43:03.800 --> 43:06.820
Director Jiang. The child's fever still hasn't broken.

411
43:06.820 --> 43:09.460
It has now developed into acute pneumonia.

412
43:09.460 --> 43:11.500
The facilities here are rather limited.

413
43:11.500 --> 43:13.039
If we don't send him to the hospital,

414
43:13.039 --> 43:16.079
I'm afraid he won't make it through the night.

415
43:20.440 --> 43:21.820
Send him to the hospital.

416
43:23.119 --> 43:24.440
Use the best medicine available.

417
43:24.440 --> 43:26.839
Yes, sir. I'll arrange it immediately.

418
44:11.520 --> 44:12.659
Where's the child?

419
44:12.659 --> 44:14.440
How can the child be gone?

420
44:14.440 --> 44:15.519
We're finished.

421
44:15.519 --> 44:16.739
Who was on duty last night?

422
44:16.739 --> 44:18.960
This is the child Director Jiang sent here.

423
44:18.960 --> 44:21.753
If he's lost, what are we going to do?

424
44:22.579 --> 44:24.360
What's the panic?

425
44:24.360 --> 44:26.080
If he's lost, he's lost.

426
44:26.080 --> 44:28.360
Can't you see?

427
44:28.360 --> 44:31.173
This child is a thorn in Director Jiang's side.

428
44:31.880 --> 44:34.900
He's the bastard of his woman and some other man.

429
44:34.900 --> 44:39.720
Now that the child is lost, or even dead,

430
44:39.720 --> 44:43.446
Director Jiang will have one less thorn in his side.

431
44:43.446 --> 44:45.179
The child already had a high fever.

432
44:45.179 --> 44:47.340
As long as we get our stories straight

433
44:47.340 --> 44:51.920
and say he couldn't be saved from an acute infection,

434
44:51.920 --> 44:53.940
Director Jiang won't blame us.

435
44:59.006 --> 45:00.400
Have you heard?

436
45:00.400 --> 45:02.544
Word came from the hospital.

437
45:02.544 --> 45:04.725
The child is gone.

438
45:05.559 --> 45:07.219
He's dead?

439
45:07.219 --> 45:08.820
The fever turned into pneumonia.

440
45:08.820 --> 45:10.599
Plus, he was in shock.

441
45:11.659 --> 45:13.400
What a tragedy.

442
45:13.400 --> 45:15.639
Poor Miss Ye. She doesn't know yet.

443
45:15.639 --> 45:19.019
If she finds out, she'll lose her mind.

444
45:19.019 --> 45:21.519
Keep it down. She might hear you.

445
45:21.519 --> 45:23.619
- She won't. - You...

446
45:23.619 --> 45:25.039
What did you say?

447
45:25.039 --> 45:26.400
- Miss Ye. - Miss Ye.

448
45:27.039 --> 45:28.260
What happened to my child?

449
45:28.260 --> 45:29.300
- Miss Ye. - Tell me!

450
45:29.300 --> 45:30.960
What happened to my child?

451
45:30.960 --> 45:32.199
Your child...

452
45:32.199 --> 45:34.739
Your child is already...

453
45:34.739 --> 45:36.039
Already...

454
45:40.280 --> 45:41.680
- Miss Ye. - Miss Ye.

455
45:41.680 --> 45:45.006
Call the doctor!
